Secure Crops for Horizon 26.3 (version 0.4.0)

A port of Secure Crops 2.0.0 by zekk051.
Original source: https://github.com/zekk051/secure-crops
Original licence: MIT

Ported to Horizon by lavoide: the rules are re-implemented in Rust on Horizon's mod API (no Java
code is included). This port is distributed under the same licence as the original (MIT); the licence text is in LICENSE. Built
against Horizon's exact-build SDK dd67b76ff23e28c6d8e21859df600d31572f81a0.

The 2.0.0 jar names MIT and ships no licence file; LICENSE is the MIT text with the author's name.
